sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Frontend
    participant Auth
    participant Agent as admin-service
    participant Graph as LangGraph
    participant Retrieval
    participant LLM

    Admin->>UI: Poser une question
    UI->>Auth: Verifier la session
    Auth-->>UI: Session valide
    UI->>Agent: Envoyer la demande
    Agent->>Graph: Classifier l'intention
    Graph->>Retrieval: Recuperer le contexte
    Retrieval-->>Graph: Sources utiles
    Graph->>LLM: Generer la reponse
    LLM-->>Graph: Reponse contextuelle
    Graph-->>UI: Retourner la reponse
    UI-->>Admin: Afficher la reponse
